    "start": 1168.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在明尼阿波利斯開槍擊斃了",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1171.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "三十七歲白人女子的續建",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1174.56,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "連續多日在當地引發街頭示威",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1178.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而上週末更是有數萬人",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1181.56,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "冒著零下的低溫走上街頭",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1185.56,
    "duration": 7,
    "text": "明尼阿波利斯市中心大馬路",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1192.56,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "十號零下六到八度",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1194.56,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "酷寒的天候下",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1195.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "聚集了成千上萬的示威者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1198.56,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "高舉各式標語",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1199.56,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "並大聲呼喊要移民",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1201.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "及海關執法局ICE滾出當地",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1204.56,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "七號遭ICE探員羅斯開槍打死的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1212.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "三十七歲白人女子瑞妮古德",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1215.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "是美國公民又是退伍軍人一雙",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1218.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "事發當時剛送孩子上學回家",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1221.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "國土安全部辯稱探員是正當訪問",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1224.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "還將案件定位為國內恐怖主義",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1227.56,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "遭明尼阿波利斯民主黨籍的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1229.56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "市長弗萊批評是一派胡言",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1232.56,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "表示只要有看過案發影片",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1234.56,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "就會知道執法人員當下",
